    "shortDescription": "Fast preinfusion and pressureized blooming",
    "description": "This profile rewards classic espresso: medium and darker roasts, traditional blends and aims to replicate the nuanced extraction characteristics of traditional manual lever espresso machines. \n\nA quick pre-infusion phase at low pressure to evenly saturate the puck. After 10 seconds, the pressure ramps up to the set 'Target Pressure' and then gradually declines."
